            "notes": "**ROUND 1**\n\nWe're gonna be starting [Whirlwhip](item_35a738cd-73d3-4d6c-86e4-76df3eeb7df6) because our main priority is to make money early. It also has synergy with our items. \n\n[Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) will basically have 100% uptime the entire round since we're contributing AOE damage on every kill. \n\n[Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) is our obvious round 1 BiS. It heals 25 PER TARGET. PER SWING. Synergizes with [Whirlwhip](item_35a738cd-73d3-4d6c-86e4-76df3eeb7df6) for huge aoe heals.",
