            "notes": "**ROUND 5**\n\nNow we need to tank up. \n\nOne of the shortcomings of this build is that your ult charge will suffer at this point since we aren't taking [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) and [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4). You can spend a measly 4000 credits to overcome this gap and get 25 health with [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c). It normally is pretty inefficient but our ult is so strong that it more than makes up for this.\n\n[Biolight Overflow](item_1220eaec-f913-4de2-816c-0dc070b285d0) is the unsung hero of this build because you can cleanse [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) burn with it. Even if they don't have an [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), you can cleanse [Charge](ability_15fea890-a958-4263-9fee-c7c13d909ba7), [Earthshatter](ability_f8f0fa28-b544-4a28-b074-146e7087fc3a), and your own tank's [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).",
