            "notes": "**ROUND 5**\n\nBy this point, you should be down about 20k credits from the rest of the lobby. That's totally normal because people NEED to avoid you or kill you to deny massive value, so you're getting a ton of value mostly by creating space and tempo. We're picking up [Righteous Cleave](item_fa98450c-b553-431d-997a-60fe2b0abb51) for massive burst healing to complament our permanent HoT spam.\n\n[Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e) lets us SPAM between left trigger and triangle for like 2 [Repair Pack](ability_dcad0648-f36b-44cf-9d5e-22af3744e6e4)s per second. \n\nYou're gonna be creating a LOT of space with this setup. The enemy will be capturing the point, and your whole team will be in spawn.",
